WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:06.210
It is a big day today or yesterday was a big
day, Donald Trump conceded the election to

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:07.210
Joe Biden.

00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:09.310
Now, I'm not going to click bait you guys.

00:00:09.310 --> 00:00:13.380
Donald Trump did not say I concede to Joe
Biden.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:16.250
That is not something Donald Trump is likely
to ever say.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:21.840
But what Donald Trump did say yesterday is,
listen, I'm still suing people, but my administration

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:27.960
is going to move forward and allow the formal
transition to take place for now.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:34.120
This is Donald Trump and this is the closest
we may ever get to a concession from him.

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:36.679
He's not saying he lost.

00:00:36.679 --> 00:00:39.180
He's not saying Biden won.

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:44.079
He's still going to file lawsuits, but he
is allowing the transition to start, which

00:00:44.079 --> 00:00:47.510
frees up money for Joe Biden to start the
transition.

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:52.589
And he reportedly did this after being told
by close confidants, including his chief of

00:00:52.589 --> 00:00:55.249
staff, Mark Meadows, it's time to start moving
on.

00:00:55.249 --> 00:00:56.440
There is no path.

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:57.649
There's really nothing else.

00:00:57.649 --> 00:00:59.209
It is time to start moving on.

00:00:59.209 --> 00:01:04.299
Now, recall that Donald Trump was holding
up the transition.

00:01:04.299 --> 00:01:10.060
That was Emily Murphy from the JESSA'S to
sort of formally put in place.

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:13.189
This is the General Services Administration.

00:01:13.189 --> 00:01:15.100
They didn't start the process.

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:17.950
Emily Murphy is a Trump administration official.

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:22.729
Trump had not directed her to start this process
because Donald Trump hadn't conceded and the

00:01:22.729 --> 00:01:25.369
pressure continued building.

00:01:25.369 --> 00:01:32.250
And finally, after weeks yesterday, Donald
Trump tweeted, I want to thank Emily Murphy

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:37.520
at GSA for her steadfast dedication and loyalty
to our country.

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:40.770
She has been harassed, threatened and abused.

00:01:40.770 --> 00:01:45.869
And I do not want to see this happen to her
or her family or employees of GSA.

00:01:45.869 --> 00:01:48.170
Our case strongly continues.

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:51.420
We will keep up the good fight and I believe
we will prevail.

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:53.080
No, you won't.

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:57.930
Nevertheless, in the best interest of our
country, I am recommending that Emily and

00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:02.509
her team do what needs to be done with regard
to initial protocols.

00:02:02.509 --> 00:02:06.009
And I have done I have told my team to do
the same.

00:02:06.009 --> 00:02:10.730
So for Donald Trump, this is admitting defeat.

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:12.380
This is the concession.

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:14.950
Nothing else now needs to happen.

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:16.600
Nothing else needed to happen.

00:02:16.600 --> 00:02:20.590
Even without this, even without the formal
transition, Joe Biden would become president

00:02:20.590 --> 00:02:22.150
on January 20th.

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:24.540
But now there is simply nothing else.

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:27.390
And Donald Trump says he will keep fighting.

00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:29.250
He says he still thinks he won.

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:34.130
He's even saying he thinks he will prevail,
but he is allowing the process to start.

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:39.470
Now, on the other end of this, Emily Murphy
wrote a letter to the Biden campaign.

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:45.680
And it is just comically unprofessional and
self-serving.

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:49.950
It is all about her, which I guess runs in
the Trump administration.

00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:54.480
Emily Murphy wrote that all the media reports
about her are wrong.

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:56.430
She was not acting politically.

00:02:56.430 --> 00:02:58.150
She did nothing incorrect.

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:06.320
She has to ascertain the apparent results
of the presidential election, not impose the

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:08.710
president elect on the country.

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:11.730
She points out she doesn't certify the winner.

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:13.420
She doesn't pick the winner.

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:15.080
There were legal challenges.

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:19.410
And I have to tell you guys, this is all complete
and utter nonsense.

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:24.350
She claims she can't do anything until results
are certified.

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:27.540
That's not true in every election.

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:35.020
The results are not really truly fully certified
until the electors vote in December.

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:40.760
And yet somehow in 2016, GSA started the transition
in November.

00:03:40.760 --> 00:03:43.180
In 2012, there was no transition.

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:48.590
But the results were were were as far as the
GSA was concerned, clear within days of the

00:03:48.590 --> 00:03:49.590
election.

00:03:49.590 --> 00:03:51.980
Same thing in 2008, same thing in the year
2000.

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:53.930
This is absolute and total nonsense.

00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:59.200
The whole letter that she wrote is a self
aggrandizing mess, which you can read in full

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:00.870
if you're so inclined.

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:04.590
I don't find it necessary to give you the
full contents of the letter today.

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:06.760
Bottom line is this.

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:14.290
Donald Trump had close aides go to him and
say it's time we have to move on this.

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:16.800
There's really nothing else that we can do.

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:23.380
Donald Trump, without saying I lost fair and
square, without saying Joe Biden will be president,

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:25.540
he said go ahead.

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:28.990
And now she says, Emily Murphy, go ahead.

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:31.460
And this is this is it.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:38.610
This entire interim period will be an asterisk
in the history books of one of the most dystopian

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:42.270
authoritarian attempts to steal the election.

00:04:42.270 --> 00:04:44.930
It will obviously be unsuccessful.

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:48.150
We knew weeks ago that it would be unsuccessful.

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:52.250
And now with the start of the formal transition,
six point three million dollars, it's freed

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:54.360
up for Joe Biden's transition.

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:59.410
Another million is freed up for what's called
appointee orientation being.

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:00.430
Bang, boom.

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:04.170
Things are moving ahead fully and completely
at this point in time.

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:08.820
This is the closest thing we are ever going
to see to a concession from Donald Trump.

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:14.980
Trump has been urged even by many Republicans,
to start this transition more formally.

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:18.950
It's not clear Donald Trump is really listening
to those people.

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:23.490
It seems some of his closest aides came to
him and said, you've got to do it.

00:05:23.490 --> 00:05:24.650
You really should do it.

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:25.920
And it is happening.

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:31.090
And we are one step closer to moving on from
this national nightmare of a complete and

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:32.090
total fiasco.

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:37.610
And the questions that remain are really sort
of academic questions, right?

00:05:37.610 --> 00:05:40.990
What will Donald Trump do between now and
January 20th?

00:05:40.990 --> 00:05:45.660
Will we see him return to the public eye in
any capacity today?

00:05:45.660 --> 00:05:51.600
He'll be doing some kind of Thanksgiving turkey
ceremony or something like that with Melania.

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:53.050
Will he ever take questions again?

00:05:53.050 --> 00:05:55.139
Will he attend the inauguration?

00:05:55.139 --> 00:05:57.820
Will he ever invite Joe Biden to the White
House?

00:05:57.820 --> 00:05:59.970
We don't have the answers to these questions.

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:04.970
The the answers are largely irrelevant to
the broader priorities of the country at this

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:05.970
time.

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:07.210
Joe Biden is moving forward.

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:09.980
He continues to make cabinet selections.

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:49.639
And that's what I want to talk about next,
because this 

00:06:49.639 --> 00:07:05.980
is 

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:21.159
really important.

